SOLUTION 1  River Water
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10      charge
    temp    25
    units   mg/L

SOLUTION 2  Seawater
    pH      8.1
    Cl      19000   charge
    temp    25
    units   mg/L

MIX 1
    1   0.7
    2   0.3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           mix_waters2.sel
    -reset          false
    -pH             true
    -activities     H+

END
